// Package policy provides protobuf definitions for the Policy service.
//
// Policy is the entitlements introspection and dev tools microservice. It
// provides service catalog browsing, entitlement inspection, entitlement
// simulation, and arbitrary OPA policy evaluation — all extracted from
// identity so the auth gateway can focus purely on authentication.
//
// Policy reads identity's verifying_keys (via Watch RO) to verify access
// tokens for GetMyEntitlements. All other RPCs operate on config-provided
// data (service_entitlements, OPA policies) and require no token validation.

